<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>This (simple) macro automates the execution of the quest so that you can go about your business. TIP: so that you don't get killed by the dio/evil rker, go to the secret room/to the place where you buy skins</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>2</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 29 1
Delay 3705 ms
KeyUp 29 1
Delay 12335 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Roblox</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>